  "blocks": [
    { "type": "explanation", "markdown": "Most German verbs ending in **-en** (like *lernen*, *arbeiten*, *machen*) follow a regular pattern:\n\nich **-e** · du **-st** · er/sie/es **-t** · wir **-en** · ihr **-t** · sie/Sie **-en**\n\ne.g. *lernen* → lern**e**, lern**st**, lern**t**, lern**en**, lern**t**, lern**en**." },
    { "type": "exercise", "exerciseId": "de-ex-en-1" },
    { "type": "exercise", "exerciseId": "de-ex-en-2" },
    { "type": "exercise", "exerciseId": "de-ex-en-3" },
    { "type": "exercise", "exerciseId": "de-ex-en-4" }
  ],
